</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 1.26, pp.18–19, scans 33–34; circuit input restriction from Definitions 5.16–5.17, pp.79–80, scans 94–95"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限关系输出词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 是给定的输入结构类；省略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 时取全部有限非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-结构。变量序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((x_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\geq1\">\\(h\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_h^{(k)}\">\\(\\bar x_h^{(k)}\\)</span> 是下式固定的绑定变量块。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_h\">\\(\\bar x_h\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> 分别为本条固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 后的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_h^{(k)}\">\\(\\bar x_h^{(k)}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_1^{(k)}\">\\(\\bar x_1^{(k)}\\)</span>；这些块是规范绑定约定，不是另行任意选择的隐藏参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)\\in\\operatorname{Spec}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\">\\(\\Phi=(\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)\\in\\operatorname{Spec}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>。有限元组替换及满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 仅用于存在唯一见证的集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_h^{(k)}\\coloneqq(x_{(h-1)k},\\ldots,x_{hk-1}),\\qquad\\bar x_h\\coloneqq\\bar x_h^{(k)},\\qquad\\bar x\\coloneqq\\bar x_1^{(k)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar x_h^{(k)}\\coloneqq(x_{(h-1)k},\\ldots,x_{hk-1}),\\qquad\\bar x_h\\coloneqq\\bar x_h^{(k)},\\qquad\\bar x\\coloneqq\\bar x_1^{(k)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Spec}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma^{1+r+s}\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x),\\\\&amp;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_i)\\subseteq\\bigcup_{h=1}^{a_i}\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_h),\\\\&amp;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,s\\}\\;\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi_j)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Spec}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\varphi_0,\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma^{1+r+s}\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x),\\\\&amp;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_i)\\subseteq\\bigcup_{h=1}^{a_i}\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x_h),\\\\&amp;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,s\\}\\;\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi_j)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_\\Phi^A\\coloneqq\\{\\bar b\\in|A|^k\\mid A\\models\\varphi_0[\\bar b/\\bar x]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_\\Phi^A\\coloneqq\\{\\bar b\\in|A|^k\\mid A\\models\\varphi_0[\\bar b/\\bar x]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Spec}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\left(D_\\Phi^A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\bigwedge_{j=1}^s\\exists!\\bar b\\in D_\\Phi^A\\;A\\models\\psi_j[\\bar b/\\bar x]\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Spec}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\left(D_\\Phi^A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\bigwedge_{j=1}^s\\exists!\\bar b\\in D_\\Phi^A\\;A\\models\\psi_j[\\bar b/\\bar x]\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\begin{aligned}R_{i,\\Phi}^A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar b_1,\\ldots,\\bar b_{a_i})\\in(D_\\Phi^A)^{a_i}\\mid A\\models\\varphi_i[\\bar b_1,\\ldots,\\bar b_{a_i}/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_{a_i}]\\},\\\\c_{j,\\Phi}^A&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota\\bar b\\in D_\\Phi^A\\;(A\\models\\psi_j[\\bar b/\\bar x]),\\\\I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\left(|B|=D_\\Phi^A\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^r R_i^B=R_{i,\\Phi}^A\\land\\bigwedge_{j=1}^s c_j^B=c_{j,\\Phi}^A\\right).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\begin{aligned}R_{i,\\Phi}^A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar b_1,\\ldots,\\bar b_{a_i})\\in(D_\\Phi^A)^{a_i}\\mid A\\models\\varphi_i[\\bar b_1,\\ldots,\\bar b_{a_i}/\\bar x_1,\\ldots,\\bar x_{a_i}]\\},\\\\c_{j,\\Phi}^A&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota\\bar b\\in D_\\Phi^A\\;(A\\models\\psi_j[\\bar b/\\bar x]),\\\\I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\left(|B|=D_\\Phi^A\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^r R_i^B=R_{i,\\Phi}^A\\land\\bigwedge_{j=1}^s c_j^B=c_{j,\\Phi}^A\\right).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D}\\mid\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D}\\mid\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]],\\qquad I_\\Phi\\coloneqq I_\\Phi^{\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]}\\quad(\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]],\\qquad I_\\Phi\\coloneqq I_\\Phi^{\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]}\\quad(\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 1.26，印刷页18–19、扫描页33–34。输出域非空且每个输出常量有唯一见证，定描述才良定义。带输入论域参数的接口是本地显式扩展，原先两个参数接口完整保留为默认特例。它使电路生成器可以只要求在标准全零数值串上合法；不能要求一个无输入常量的FO解释在任意全空关系的对称结构中选择唯一输出根，这会错误地把整个一致电路类变成空类。对所有后续调用，输入论域必须明确，不能由Remark暗补。</p>\n<p>本轮固定绑定变量块并显式列出语法候选集；自由变量约束作用于变量块的分量集合。输出通过唯一满足全部解释条件的结构定义，不把“关系解释序列”误作一个关系解释。原先变量块可任意改名的表达能力保留；不再把同一公式元组与未记录的绑定顺序组合成多个不同查询。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-l