q\\iota\\bar b\\in D_\\Phi^A\\;(A\\models\\psi_j[\\bar b/\\bar x]),\\\\I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D}(A)&\\coloneqq\\iota B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\left(|B|=D_\\Phi^A\\land\\bigwedge_{i=1}^r R_i^B=R_{i,\\Phi}^A\\land\\bigwedge_{j=1}^s c_j^B=c_{j,\\Phi}^A\\right).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D}\\mid\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]],\\qquad I_\\Phi\\coloneqq I_\\Phi^{\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]}\\quad(\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Adm}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]].","display":true}],"bytes":4580,"backlinks":[{"id":"6b1e7a4a516bab79","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\geq1}$；$Z_n=\\mathfrak A_{0^n}^{<,\\mathrm{BIT},S}$ 是标准全零字符串结构；$\\mathcal Z=\\{Z_n:n\\geq1\\}$ 是合法生成输入集合；$\\mathrm{FOQuery}_d[\\sigma,\\tau_c;\\mathcal Z]$ 见 [[29-df-fo-query]]，仅在该集合上要求输出域非空及根常量唯一。"},{"id":"9e37f96b88bff2af","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\geq1$，$\\Phi=(\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)$ 的变量分组和非空、常量唯一性接口沿用 [[29-df-fo-query]]。"},{"id":"65b448b4269ca18e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D]$ 见 [[29-df-fo-query]]；下式还要求所有合法输入的像在 $\\mathcal E$ 内。无域参数的归约采用全体非空有限结构。"},{"id":"08afaae97db1d476","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau;\\mathcal D_\\sigma]$ 见 [[29-df-fo-query]]；下式使用带词汇标签的查询，避免不同词汇的空模型集被混同。$\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b$ 遍历下式 $\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak D}$。"},{"id":"ca9dcc9ec1866c06","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10608c2a55a773a6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-query]]、[[29-df-fo-q-fo]] — 一阶可定义查询"},{"id":"83f36b68a9cb059f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}$，$I_1\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_k[\\sigma,\\tau]$、$I_2\\in\\mathrm{FOQuery}_m[\\tau,\\upsilon]$；合法性取 [[29-df-fo-query]]。"},{"id":"bc5b8d55ec7833aa","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-query]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-fo-query]]"}],"outgoing":["4de8e0c8085801f5","28e86a5f0243a0ae","ff5b73e2fc5d5965","3ee556c64b16809b","db2b32546860e623","ad08b66c5e54a436","0ac4b9a122d458e2"]}